  "summary": "A hair manipulation technique using thread to create textured patterns and styles without chemical treatments.",
  "description": "Threading involves wrapping sections of hair with thread to create intricate patterns, twists, and textured styles that enhance natural hair texture. This technique developed across various African regions as a protective styling method that preserves hair while allowing for creative expression without heat or chemical damage.",
